'' AN OS TABLE IS READ ONLY FOR ITS OS (TK-003): a build for Windows takes [target.app.windows]'s
'' resource and not [target.app.linux]'s define. The table adds to the target's own keys.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_MODCACHE=build/.bow/cache
'' CLEAN: build/.bow
'' ARGS: metadata -target windows-x86_64 --manifest tests/driver/src/build-os
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: "resources":["tests/driver/src/build-os/res/app.rc"]
'' EXPECT-NOT: LINUXONLY
